    <description>Reacts to MuleSoft updates on Integration_Transaction__c (JIRA). PROVISIONING rows: copies the Jira key, status and error to the Opportunity (JIRA_SETUP_*) and stamps Account.Neon_CRM_Instance_Created_Date__c when the ticket reaches System Ready (status id 10805). DEACTIVATION rows (Scenario 2, one row per product line): copies the deactivation ticket key or the error into that line's pair of Opportunity fields (Neon_CRM_ / Fundraise_ / Arts_People_Cancellation_JIRA__c and _Error__c), only when the key or the error is new (status syncs from Jira do not rewrite the Opportunity); a rejected Opportunity write is noted, not propagated, so MuleSoft's registry write succeeds and the row stays the audit trail. MuleSoft writes only the transaction row; this Flow owns every Opportunity/Account effect.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_KeyPresent</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.External_Key__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_StatusIdNewlySet</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(ISNEW(), ISCHANGED({!$Record.External_Status_Id__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_KeyNewlySet</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(ISNEW(), ISCHANGED({!$Record.External_Key__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_ErrorNewlySet</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(ISNEW(), ISCHANGED({!$Record.Request_Status__c}), ISCHANGED({!$Record.Last_Error_Short__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_InstanceCreatedDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.Status_Changed_At__c}), TODAY(), DATEVALUE({!$Record.Status_Changed_At__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Integration Transaction | Apply Jira Updates {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Integration Transaction | After Save | Apply Jira Updates</label>
